# CATALOG.md and catalog.json are generated from the component frontmatter, and
# `npm run catalog:check` regenerates them and compares the result byte for byte
# against what is committed. A checkout on Windows applies core.autocrlf and
# rewrites every text file to CRLF, after which the generator's LF output no
# longer matches the file beside it and the gate reports drift that no diff
# explains.
#
# text=auto still lets git detect and leave binaries alone (the visual baselines
# under visual-baseline/).
* text=auto eol=lf
